<title>USA: Nassau County, N.Y., to sell $94 GOs mln Oct 30. [CORRECTED 13:58 GMT]</title>
<headline>Nassau County, N.Y., to sell $94 GOs mln Oct 30. [CORRECTED 13:58 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects sale date in headline and text from November 30 to October 30.)</p>
<p>Nassau County, N.Y., said it plans to sell $94.2 million of general obligation bonds on October 30 through competitive sale.</p>
<p>The county plans to sell $89.8 million of general improvement general obligation bonds and $4.4 million of sewer district general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
